        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekibi kya Nadabbu na Abihu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, Nadabbu na Abihu batabani ba Arooni, buli omu yakwata ekiswa kye, yakitaho omurro, yataho eseeta baahonga omurro ogutarukwikirizibwa hali MUKAMA, habwokuba akaba atabaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurro gwaruga hali MUKAMA, gwabahwerekereza, baafeera omumaiso ga MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Musa yagambira Arooni ati: “MUKAMA agambire ati: ‘Omu bantu abarukunyirra haihi, ndaayeyoleka ndi arukwera kandi omumaiso g'abantu boona ndaasuukura ekitiinisa kyange.’ ” Arooni yaculeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yayeta Misairi na Erizefani batabani ba Huzieri nyinarumi Arooni, yabagambira ati: “Mwirre haihi muhimbe bagenzi baanyu, mubaihe omumaiso ag'Ekiikaro Ekirukwera, mubaturukye aheeru y'orukande.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bairra haihi baabahimbira omu kooti zaabo, baabaturukya orukande nkooku Musa akaba agambire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Musa yagambira Arooni, agambire abatabani Eryeza na Itamara ati: “Mutaleka isoke lyanyu kwikara litatiirwe, kandi kutemura ebyokujwara byanyu, timwikara kufa kandi MUKAMA taikara kubiihirirwa ekitebe ky'abantu kyona; baitu bagenzi baanyu, oruganda rwona orwa Isirairi, balirirre abo MUKAMA aba aisize omurro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mutaruga aheeru, mukahingura omulyango ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu, timwikara kufa, habwokuba mukaseeswaho amagita ga MUKAMA anyakweza abantu n'ebintu.” Baakora nkooku Musa yagambire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro ebirukulema Abanyakatagara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagambira Arooni ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutalinywa eviini rundi ekyokunywa ekindi eky'amaani, iwe rundi batabani bawe abali hamu na iwe, obu muraabaga nimugenda omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu, mutalija kufa, kinu kiragiro ekitalihwaho ebiro byanyu byoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musemeriire kumanya enyahukana ha bintu ebinyakweziibwe n'ebya buli kiro ebitarukuzirwa n'ebirukuzirwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi musemeriire kwegesa abantu ba Isirairi ebiragiro MUKAMA ebi yaragiire Musa kubagambira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
