            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.14+LEV.6.15+LEV.6.16+LEV.6.17+LEV.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 6:14-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yagambira Arooni n'abatabani Eryeza na Itamara abakaba basigaireho ati: “Mukwate ekihongwa eky'ekyokulya ekinyakusigaire ha bihongwa ebinyakwokiibwe habwa MUKAMA, mukirye kitatumbisiibwe, mwikaliire ha rubaju rw'itambiro, habwokuba kyeziibwe mali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukiriire Omukiikaro Ekirukwera, habwokuba mugabo gwawe n'abatabani bawe, ogurukuruga ha bihongwa ebinyakwokiibwe habwa MUKAMA, habwokuba nukwo ndagiirwe nti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.30+LEV.7.31+LEV.7.32+LEV.7.33+LEV.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 7:30-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ekifuba ekinyakwimukyaimukiibwe n'ekirumbu ekinyakuhongerwe, musobora kubiriira omu kiikaro ekyecumi, iwe, batabani bawe na bahara bawe ab'onyinaho, habwokuba obihairwe gube mugabo gwawe abaana bawe ogunyakurugire ha byonzira ebinyakuhongwa habw'okusaba obusinge ekinyakuleesirwe abantu ba Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekirumbu eki ekinyakuhongerwe n'ekifuba ekiimukaimukiibwe babireete n'ekihongwa eky'ebisajwa ebyokiibwe kubiimukyaimukiza MUKAMA, guraaba mugabo gwawe kandi gwa batabani bawe ab'onyinabo, gube mugabo ogwa buli na buli; nkooku MUKAMA aragiire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akakaguliiriza muno ebigambo eby'embuzi ey'ekihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi, eky'amahano, bakaba bagyookeze. Yabiihirirwa Eryeza na Itamara batabani ba Arooni abaasigaireho yagamba ati: “Ekihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.24+LEV.6.25+LEV.6.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 6:24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwaki mutakiririire Omukiikaro ekirukwera, kandi kunu nikyo kintu ekirukwera mali, kandi mukihairwe nukwo mwetweke ebibi eby'ekitebe kubatonganira hali MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi esagama yakyo tereesirwe omu kicweka eky'omunda eky'Ekiikaro Ekirukwera nkooku naragiire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arooni yagambira Musa ati: “Wetegereze, kiro kinu bahongiirege MUKAMA ekihongwa kyabo eky'okuganyiza ebibi n'ekihongwa eky'okwokya, baitu nabwo ebintu nk'ebi bimpikireho! Kiro kinu kakuba mbaire ndiire ekihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi, MUKAMA yaakukukirize?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa obu yahuliire ekintu eki yananuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
